body:
@markstory We should at least consider it as now would be the only time we can actually do something about it as long as the API is not stable yet in 3.x. While I agree that there will be more upgrading necessary it will also be quite easy to automate the method renaming via Upgrade repo.

While most of those have historically been this way, it doesn't mean that we cannot "give them back" to the developer in 3.x as many other naming conflicts have also been resolved now, as well (File, Folder class, ...). At least where it makes sense. "render" sure needs to stay. But others might make sense to modify.

The main focus should be on "cell" and the introduction of this reserved word, though.
